n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           秋季拼配在我们季节拼配里的颜色是“黄色”，今年让我们很惊喜的是除了以往哥伦产区的风味豆子之外，我们还从亚洲产区种选到了有黄色水果风味调性的两只很棒的豆子：\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           云南临沧秋珀的萨奇姆\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           有很轻盈舒适的苹果，奶油，一点点人参果蜜瓜感；印尼的龙果是我心心念了好多年，今年终于买到了有更具象的人参果和蜜瓜，也有奶油感；配合哥伦两只更偏黄色热带水果调性的贝塔尼亚黄波旁和第一次选到豆单的圣塔伊莲娜的三只添加水果和酵母做增味发酵的豆子，共同来呈现像蜜瓜，人参果，苹果，香蕉，菠萝等黄色水果风味，然后用一只很干净的埃塞的耶加水洗（G2）与24产季中后期现在状态还不错的偏传统处理的水洗或蜜处理来衔接风味里的酸甜～此时我的脑袋里突然出现一个金字塔的画面，先写下来要给设计师说下用金字塔的不同部分来代入这几个豆子，这个主意挺好哈哈～！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           Aut\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           umn Leaves 深焙\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           风味特征（黑咖）：蜜瓜、人参果、苹果\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           （奶咖）：芝士饼干、白巧克力\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Indonesia Sumatra Aceh Longberry Wet-hulled 30%（印尼龙果）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Ethiopia SNNPR Gedeo Yirgacheffe Washed G2 40%（耶加G2）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Colombia Huila Santa Elena Pink bourbon/Aji/Ombligon Anaerobic Washed（ 10%（哥伦圣塔伊莲娜粉波/辣椒波旁/大肚脐）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Brazil Minas Gerais Fazenda Guariroba Farm Blend（2023+2024） 20%（巴西棕榈树的23产季与24产季组合）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           季节拼配的深焙产品与浅焙会有些差别，因为深焙的豆子相对来说是现在咖啡馆的主要出单产品，占比最大，同时也是支撑店里运营基础成本的主力，所以在成本+风味特征上偏向于成本的考虑更多；组成上，基础部分是耶加G2水洗打底，印尼龙果来提供自然的蜜瓜和人参果的果香，减少比例的哥伦圣塔伊莲娜增强一些黄色水果的香气强度；巴西的棕榈树23产季的瑰夏和粉波（他们的状态在深焙里特别棒）与24产季组合一起，让我们转化了生豆库存的同时也可以因豆适宜的给这个产品\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           带来整体甜感、触感和风味层次的提升；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px 0px 0em;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏淘宝店铺哦～\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"